    {
      "id": 340184,
      "username": "revant_one",
      "name": "Revant Nandgaonkar",
      "created_at": "2022-09-29T13:45:26.761Z",
      "cooked": "<p>to get token based auth</p>\n<ol>\n<li>add whitelisted endpoint <code>get-otp(user_mobile_no)</code>. It takes valid phone number, searches in users if phone exists, generates and caches phone:OTP combination, sends otp to phone.</li>\n<li>add whitelisted endpoint <code>get_token(otp)</code>. it takes OTP, searches cache, as per user, generates <code>OAuth Bearer Token</code> and returns bearer token.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>if you need otp based token to access api from mobile apps then this will be useful.</p>\n<p>it is not useful for browser session based login.</p>",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/discuss.frappe.io/revant_one/{size}/55081_2.png",
      "trust_level": 2,
